  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "திருமதுகை யாகத் திறனிலார் செய்யும்\nபெருமிதம் கண்டக் கடைத்தும் - எரிமண்டிக்\nகானந் தலைப்பட்ட தீப்போல் கனலுமே,\nமான முடையார் மனம்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Honourable minds are wroth with wealthy arrogance. The mind of those possessed of honourable feeling will kindle into flame, like the fire that has caught the forest when the conflagration rages, whenever they behold the haughty acts of those who are destitute of virtuous habits, and to whom their wealth is their only strength.",
